WEBVTT

00:06.413 --> 00:08.379
-[seagulls cawing]
-Are ya ready, kids?
-[海鸥啼叫]
-准备好了吗，孩子们？

00:08.448 --> 00:10.275
[kids]
Aye-aye, Captain!
[孩子们]
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.413 --> 00:11.862
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:11.965 --> 00:14.068
[kids] Aye-aye, Captain!
[孩子们] 是啊，队长！

00:14.137 --> 00:16.827
♪ Oh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:16.931 --> 00:18.965
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.068 --> 00:20.827
[kids]
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
[孩子们]
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:20.965 --> 00:23.034
[Painty] ♪ Absorbent,
and yellow, and porous is he ♪
[油漆] ♪ 吸收性，
黄色、多孔的是他 ♪

00:23.137 --> 00:24.724
[kids] ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
[孩子们] ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:24.793 --> 00:26.931
[Painty] ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
[Painty] ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.068 --> 00:28.620
[kids] ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
[孩子们] ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:28.724 --> 00:31.103
[Painty] ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
[Painty] ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.206 --> 00:32.931
-♪ SpongeBob SquarePants
-♪ Ready? ♪
-♪ 海绵宝宝
-♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:33.068 --> 00:34.965
[all] ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
[全部] ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:35.068 --> 00:36.965
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:37.068 --> 00:38.862
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:38.931 --> 00:42.448
[Painty]
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
[油漆]
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:42.551 --> 00:44.827
[Painty laughing]
[佩蒂笑]

00:44.931 --> 00:47.103
-[flute playing]
-[song ends]
-[长笛演奏]
-[歌曲结束]

00:47.206 --> 00:49.310
-[waves lapping]
-[seagulls cawing]
-[海浪拍打]
-[海鸥啼叫]

00:49.413 --> 00:51.965
[jaunty tropical music]
[欢快的热带音乐]

01:01.379 --> 01:04.275
[Gary snoring]
[加里打鼾]

01:04.344 --> 01:06.551
[spy music]
[间谍音乐]

01:13.482 --> 01:15.689
[snoring continues]
[鼾声继续]

01:17.655 --> 01:18.965
[SpongeBob grunts]
[海绵宝宝咕哝]

01:19.413 --> 01:20.655
Hmm?
唔？

01:27.689 --> 01:29.137
Perfect.
完美的。

01:31.172 --> 01:33.034
-Ha! Huh?
-[phone ringing]
-哈！啊？
-[电话铃声]

01:35.724 --> 01:37.413
Yes, who is it?
是的，是谁？

01:37.482 --> 01:38.965
Hey, SpongeBob!
嘿，海绵宝宝！

01:39.068 --> 01:41.827
Oh, hi, Patrick.
What's going on?
哦，嗨，帕特里克。
这是怎么回事？

01:44.034 --> 01:45.689
Just getting dressed.
刚穿好衣服。

01:45.793 --> 01:46.793
You wanna hang out?
你想出去玩吗？

01:46.862 --> 01:48.862
Oh, I can't right now.
哦，我现在不能。

01:49.000 --> 01:50.758
It's a big day for Gary.
这对加里来说是个重要的日子。

01:50.827 --> 01:53.551
His snail-mitzvah already?
他的成年礼已经完成了吗？

01:53.655 --> 01:55.000
No, that's tomorrow.
不，那是明天。

01:55.103 --> 01:59.344
Today he's going to the V-E-T.
今天他要去参加 V-E-T。

02:00.034 --> 02:03.586
Oh, I'd join you,
but I'm not dressed for the zoo.
哦，我愿意加入你，
但我没有穿好衣服去动物园。

02:03.689 --> 02:05.344
The vet, Patrick.
兽医帕特里克.

02:05.413 --> 02:07.758
Gary hates going to the vet
for his checkup,
加里讨厌去看兽医
为了他的检查，

02:07.862 --> 02:10.517
so I always have to trick him
into the pet carrier.
所以我总是要欺骗他
放入宠物笼中。

02:11.517 --> 02:14.206
[sniffing, chomping]
[嗅、咀嚼]

02:14.551 --> 02:15.793
[happy meow]
[开心喵]

02:16.241 --> 02:17.931
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

02:20.413 --> 02:25.206
I left a trail of SnailPo treats
around the bathroom...
我留下了 SnailPo 零食的踪迹
浴室周围...

02:26.310 --> 02:27.241
[meow]
[喵]

02:31.586 --> 02:32.965
...down the stairs...
……下楼梯……

02:33.068 --> 02:35.206
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

02:37.241 --> 02:39.206
...through the living room...
...穿过客厅...

02:40.586 --> 02:42.379
...and into the kitchen,
...然后走进厨房，

02:42.448 --> 02:46.344
where he'll find a pile
of treats right inside...
他会在那里找到一堆
里面有零食……

02:46.827 --> 02:48.896
[grunts] his pet carrier!
[咕哝]他的宠物笼！

02:49.413 --> 02:50.551
Gotcha, Gary!
明白了，加里！

02:50.655 --> 02:52.172
You still there, Patrick?
你还在吗，帕特里克？

02:52.275 --> 02:53.448
Still here!
还在这里！

02:53.551 --> 02:56.482
-[loud chewing]
-Patrick?
-[大声咀嚼]
-帕特里克？

02:56.586 --> 02:58.517
Great plan, SpongeBob!
伟大的计划，海绵宝宝！

02:58.620 --> 02:59.586
[vacuum noise]
[真空噪音]

02:59.724 --> 03:02.068
Gary's gonna fall for it
for sure!
加里会爱上它
当然！

03:02.172 --> 03:03.724
[burps, licking]
[打嗝，舔]

03:03.827 --> 03:05.137
[meow]
[喵]

03:05.275 --> 03:06.517
Oh, uh, hey, Gary.
哦，呃，嘿，加里。

03:06.620 --> 03:08.103
-[dramatic sting]
-[meow]
-[戏剧性的刺痛]
-[喵]

03:08.172 --> 03:09.586
Let me just...
让我...

03:09.689 --> 03:10.896
[yowls angrily]
[愤怒地嚎叫]

03:11.000 --> 03:12.655
Ah!
啊!

03:13.931 --> 03:16.000
This is gonna be harder
than I thought.
这会更难
比我想象的要多。

03:16.137 --> 03:18.000
More snail food, please!
再来点蜗牛食物吧！

03:20.862 --> 03:22.103
Okay, Gary,
好吧，加里，

03:22.206 --> 03:24.448
time for an innocent walk
with no ulterior motive.
无辜散步的时间
没有别有用心。

03:24.551 --> 03:26.551
[hisses, yowls]
[嘶嘶声，嚎叫声]

03:27.517 --> 03:29.137
I'm sorry, Gary,
对不起，加里，

03:29.241 --> 03:32.034
but you need to...
see your doctor!
但你需要...
看你的医生！

03:36.793 --> 03:38.103
[loud thud]
[巨响]

03:41.586 --> 03:42.965
[blows raspberry]
[吹覆盆子]

03:44.344 --> 03:45.724
Oh, barnacles.
哦，藤壶。

03:45.827 --> 03:49.620
Perhaps I'll need a ruse
that's even rusier.
也许我需要一个诡计
那更生锈了。

03:50.482 --> 03:53.241
[SpongeBob grunting]
[海绵宝宝咕哝]

03:53.344 --> 03:54.448
[door creaks]
[门吱吱作响]

03:56.034 --> 03:58.172
Oh, Gary, you're here!
哦，加里，你来了！

03:58.310 --> 04:00.310
Forget that silly veterinarian!
忘记那个愚蠢的兽医吧！

04:00.413 --> 04:04.827
I booked a big tropical vacation
just for the two of us!
我预订了一个热带假期
只为我们两个人！

04:04.896 --> 04:05.793
[sheepish laugh]
[羞涩的笑声]

04:06.379 --> 04:09.827
Won't it be nice to just
get away for awhile and relax?
就这样不是很好吗
离开一段时间放松一下？

04:09.931 --> 04:13.620
So just get into that vacation
carriage and we can take off!
所以就进入那个假期吧
马车我们可以起飞了！

04:15.965 --> 04:19.620
Come on, Gary,
just get in that pet carrier...
来吧，加里，
只要进入那个宠物笼...

04:19.724 --> 04:21.724
-[angry meow]
-Oh, hi, Gary.
-[生气喵]
-哦，嗨，加里。

04:21.827 --> 04:23.379
-[hisses]
-Whoa!
-[嘶嘶声]
-哇！

04:24.206 --> 04:25.965
Gary! Let me out, boy!
加里！放我出去吧，小子！

04:26.068 --> 04:27.034
Be a good snail!
做一只好蜗牛！

04:32.275 --> 04:34.482
[French narrator]
Two weeks later...
[法语旁白]
两周后...

04:36.172 --> 04:38.689
-[meow]
-Okay, okay, I'll admit it.
-[喵]
-好吧好吧，我承认。

04:38.793 --> 04:41.517
I feel rejuvenated. Hmph!
我感觉自己又恢复了活力。哼！

04:42.448 --> 04:44.517
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

04:45.275 --> 04:48.413
Look, Gary!
This letter came for you!
看，加里！
这封信是写给你的！

04:49.482 --> 04:52.344
It's an invitation
to a big party
这是一个邀请
去参加一个大型聚会

04:52.413 --> 04:54.241
at Snail Fail's house!
在蜗牛失败家！

04:54.344 --> 04:56.896
He is the most famous snail
in town,
他是最有名的蜗牛
在城里，

04:57.000 --> 04:59.758
and you're his VIP!
而你就是他的 VIP！

05:00.551 --> 05:02.241
Oh? [nervous laugh]
哦？ [紧张的笑声]

05:02.344 --> 05:04.586
-[angry meow]
-[horn honks]
-[生气喵]
-[喇叭鸣响]

05:04.689 --> 05:07.965
He even sent a limousine!
他甚至还派了一辆豪华轿车！

05:09.517 --> 05:11.793
Meow!
喵！

05:13.931 --> 05:16.620
[British accent]
After you, my good snail...
[英国口音]
在你之后，我的好蜗牛……

05:19.413 --> 05:21.068
Pretty fancy, huh?
很花哨，是吧？

05:21.137 --> 05:23.275
A pity we'll have to cancel
that vet appointment,
遗憾的是我们不得不取消
那个兽医预约，

05:23.413 --> 05:25.517
but there's no way
we could miss--
但没有办法
我们可能会错过——

05:25.586 --> 05:26.862
Patrick?!
帕特里克？！

05:26.931 --> 05:30.172
Yeah, I'm pretty hard to miss.
是的，我很难错过。

05:33.448 --> 05:34.689
Hey!
嘿！

05:35.103 --> 05:37.655
-Gary! Uh...
-[meow]
-加里！呃...
-[喵]

05:40.103 --> 05:42.413
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:46.172 --> 05:49.620
[metal smashing]
[金属粉碎]

05:51.448 --> 05:52.517
[meow]
[喵]

05:55.241 --> 05:56.931
-Ouch.
-Ow...
-哎哟。
-噢...

05:57.793 --> 06:02.586
[TV Announcer] And now
back toSnails of Our Lives.
[电视播音员] 现在
回到我们生活中的蜗牛。

06:02.689 --> 06:05.482
[kissing sounds]
[接吻声]

06:05.586 --> 06:07.862
[sentimental piano music]
【感伤的钢琴曲】

06:08.965 --> 06:12.413
Hmm. If I can't convince Gary
by lying to him,
唔。如果我不能说服加里
通过对他撒谎，

06:12.517 --> 06:15.689
I'll have to convince him
with brutal honesty!
我得说服他
带着残酷的诚实！

06:15.793 --> 06:19.379
Here comes... the guilt trip.
来了……内疚之旅。

06:22.827 --> 06:26.379
[TV Announcer] Next time
onSnails of Our Lives...
[电视播音员] 下次
关于我们生活中的蜗牛...

06:26.482 --> 06:29.103
-[female snail] Meow?
-[male snail] Meow.
-【母蜗牛】喵？
-【雄性蜗牛】喵。

06:29.206 --> 06:30.724
[sniffling]
[抽鼻子]

06:31.172 --> 06:35.103
Gary, I'm begging you.
Please go to the veterinarian!
加里，我求你了。
请去看兽医！

06:35.172 --> 06:37.896
I'm worried sick about you!
我真替你担心死了！

06:38.000 --> 06:41.068
Do you want me to be sick, Gary?
你想让我生病吗，加里？

06:41.172 --> 06:45.275
Are you trying to send me
to an early grave?!
你想发给我吗
早早进入坟墓？！

06:46.000 --> 06:48.000
Oh! Gah!
哦！嘎！

06:48.137 --> 06:51.034
I would do anything
for you, Gary!
我愿意做任何事
为了你，加里！

06:51.172 --> 06:53.000
Anything!
任何事物！

06:53.103 --> 06:54.586
[crying]
[哭泣]

06:54.655 --> 06:56.827
[wailing]
[哀号]

06:58.172 --> 07:01.551
[award announcer] And the winner
for best acting is...
[颁奖嘉宾] 获奖者
最佳表演是...

07:01.620 --> 07:03.413
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

07:03.482 --> 07:05.482
Oh! Oh, my! Thank you!
哦！哦，天哪！谢谢你！

07:05.586 --> 07:07.862
It was an honor
just to be nominated.
这是一种荣幸
只是为了被提名。

07:07.931 --> 07:09.586
If you had told me
eleven minutes ago
如果你告诉我
十一分钟前

07:09.655 --> 07:12.862
that little old SpongeBob would
win an award for anything, I--
那个小老海绵宝宝会
赢得任何奖项，我——

07:12.965 --> 07:14.275
Wait a minute!
等一下！

07:14.379 --> 07:16.620
Gary? Double barnacles!
加里？双藤壶！

07:16.724 --> 07:19.172
That sneaky snail
got away again.
那只狡猾的蜗牛
又逃走了。

07:19.275 --> 07:20.517
That's it!
就是这样！

07:21.000 --> 07:22.896
I am taking Gary to the vet...
我要带加里去看兽医...

07:23.000 --> 07:26.344
by any means necessary.
通过任何必要的手段。

07:32.965 --> 07:35.965
No more Mr. Nice Sponge.
不再是好海绵先生了。

07:36.758 --> 07:39.827
[adventurous music]
[冒险音乐]

07:41.344 --> 07:43.689
Time for a snail hunt!
是时候去捉蜗牛了！

07:45.862 --> 07:47.068
La la la la la!
啦啦啦啦啦！

07:49.206 --> 07:50.137
Hmm...
唔...

07:51.758 --> 07:53.965
[lick] Still warm.
[舔]还是暖和的。

07:55.586 --> 07:58.862
[gasp] A fresh kill...
[喘息]新鲜的杀戮......

07:58.931 --> 08:00.586
[munching]
[咀嚼]

08:05.379 --> 08:08.000
Aha! Gotcha!
啊哈！明白了！

08:11.689 --> 08:12.931
[surprised meow]
[惊讶喵]

08:18.344 --> 08:20.310
[angry yowl]
[愤怒的咆哮]

08:22.241 --> 08:23.275
[meow]
[喵]

08:27.517 --> 08:30.103
I see you've fallen
into one of the many traps
我看到你已经堕落了
陷入众多陷阱之一

08:30.206 --> 08:31.827
I've set around the house.
我已经在房子周围布置好了。

08:32.448 --> 08:33.379
Whoa!
哇！

08:33.482 --> 08:35.448
-[shouting]
-[angry meows]
-[喊叫]
-[愤怒的喵喵声]

08:39.413 --> 08:41.931
[steam hissing]
[蒸汽嘶嘶声]

08:42.862 --> 08:44.862
[drain gurgling]
[排水沟咕噜声]

08:46.482 --> 08:47.379
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

08:47.517 --> 08:51.034
Hey, a little privacy please?
嘿，请有点隐私吗？

08:57.482 --> 08:59.758
Vet time!
兽医时间！

08:59.827 --> 09:01.034
[yowls]
[嚎叫]

09:01.655 --> 09:02.862
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:09.482 --> 09:11.655
[laser buzzing]
[激光嗡嗡声]

09:13.344 --> 09:15.275
[hypnotized meow]
[催眠喵]

09:16.379 --> 09:17.448
Meow!
喵！

09:18.000 --> 09:19.034
Meow!
喵！

09:22.034 --> 09:24.793
That's it, Gary, follow the dot.
就这样，加里，跟着点走。

09:27.758 --> 09:31.724
Let's just think rationally
here, Gary. Heh.
我们理性思考一下
在这里，加里。呵呵。

09:39.482 --> 09:40.586
[yowl]
[号叫]

09:40.689 --> 09:43.586
-[angry meowing]
-[shouting]
-[愤怒的喵喵声]
-[喊叫]

09:47.137 --> 09:50.551
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

09:51.758 --> 09:56.137
[Spaghetti Western
showdown music]
[意大利式西部片
对决音乐]

09:58.586 --> 10:00.758
[rousing music playing]
[振奋人心的音乐]

10:02.103 --> 10:03.896
[angry meow]
[生气喵]

10:04.413 --> 10:06.482
Ooh! [inhales]
哦！ [吸气]

10:09.827 --> 10:11.000
Meow!
喵！

10:12.551 --> 10:13.413
Gotcha!
明白了！

10:13.517 --> 10:15.482
[squeaky punches landing]
[吱吱作响的拳头落地]

10:16.103 --> 10:17.827
[veterinarian]
Mr. SquarePants?
[兽医]
方裤先生？

10:17.896 --> 10:20.551
You may bring in your snail now.
你现在可以把你的蜗牛带进来了。

10:22.517 --> 10:25.758
[muffled growling]
[低沉的咆哮声]

10:28.517 --> 10:32.068
Goodness, Gary!
What healthy teeth you have!
天哪，加里！
你的牙齿多么健康啊！

10:32.172 --> 10:34.206
[chomp, munching]
[咀嚼，咀嚼]

10:34.310 --> 10:35.413
Ptoo!
噗！

10:35.551 --> 10:38.172
Gary, be nice
to the kind doctor!
加里，乖一点
致善良的医生！

10:38.275 --> 10:40.965
Oh, that's quite alright,
Mr. SquarePants.
噢，那完全没问题，
方裤先生。

10:41.068 --> 10:45.137
I know exactly how to handle
vicious snails.
我清楚地知道如何处理
恶毒的蜗牛。

10:45.241 --> 10:46.758
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

10:46.862 --> 10:48.620
With a...
与一个...

10:48.724 --> 10:50.172
lollipop!
棒糖！

10:50.241 --> 10:51.620
Meow?
喵？

10:55.551 --> 10:56.448
All done.
全部完成。

10:56.551 --> 10:57.448
That's it?
就是这样？

10:57.586 --> 10:59.793
Yep. That's a medical lollipop
是的。这是医用棒棒糖

10:59.896 --> 11:02.793
full of all the vitamins
and vaccinations
富含所有维生素
和疫苗接种

11:02.896 --> 11:04.655
a growing snail needs.
成长中的蜗牛需要。

11:04.758 --> 11:06.000
See, Gary?
看到了吗，加里？

11:06.137 --> 11:08.827
That wasn't so bad after all.
毕竟那还不算太糟糕。

11:08.965 --> 11:09.965
Well, thanks, Doctor.
嗯，谢谢，医生。

11:10.103 --> 11:11.482
See ya next year!
明年见！

11:12.620 --> 11:14.689
Oh, you can't leave,
Mr. SquarePants.
噢，你不能离开，
方裤先生。

11:14.827 --> 11:16.965
You're covered in bites
and scratches.
你被咬伤了
和划痕。

11:17.068 --> 11:18.413
[nervous laugh] Uh, yeah,
[紧张的笑声] 呃，是的，

11:18.517 --> 11:20.724
Gary did get a little rough
on the way over here.
加里确实有点粗暴
正在来这里的路上。

11:20.793 --> 11:22.551
I guess I'll take a lollipop,
too!
我想我会带一根棒棒糖
也！

11:22.655 --> 11:26.000
Oh, no,
sponges don't get lollipops.
哦，不，
海绵不能得到棒棒糖。

11:26.103 --> 11:29.344
You don't want to get infected,
so you'll need
你不想被感染，
所以你需要

11:29.448 --> 11:31.758
the full treatment!
全面治疗！

11:31.827 --> 11:34.310
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

11:34.413 --> 11:36.379
[screams]
[尖叫声]

11:37.241 --> 11:38.827
[sigh]
[叹]

11:41.275 --> 11:43.793
I don't wanna go to the vet!
我不想去看兽医！

11:43.896 --> 11:46.517
[crying]
[哭泣]

11:47.448 --> 11:51.517
[lively tropical music]
[活泼的热带音乐]

11:58.137 --> 12:00.034
[male fitness instructor]
And five! And four!
【男健身教练】
还有五个！还有四个！

12:00.137 --> 12:03.448
And three!
And two! And one!
还有三个！
还有两个！还有一个！

12:03.517 --> 12:04.620
Great job!
干得好！

12:04.724 --> 12:06.724
You've finished your warm-up.
你已经完成了热身。

12:06.827 --> 12:12.241
Now pop in another quarter and
let's get to the real workout!
现在弹出另一个四分之一
让我们开始真正的锻炼吧！

12:13.310 --> 12:14.689
Whew!
哇！

12:14.827 --> 12:18.413
Just the warm-up today,
Mr. Pelican machine.
今天只是热身，
鹈鹕先生机器。

12:18.517 --> 12:21.000
And now for my next workout...
现在我的下一次锻炼......

12:21.103 --> 12:24.275
[deep inhale, blows]
[深吸气，吹气]

12:24.379 --> 12:26.413
The speed bag!
速度包！

12:26.482 --> 12:27.482
What?!
什么？！

12:27.931 --> 12:29.379
[grunts]
[咕哝]

12:32.344 --> 12:33.620
Yes!
是的！

12:37.034 --> 12:38.413
[groans]
[呻吟]

12:39.275 --> 12:40.655
Feel the burn!
感受灼烧感！

12:40.758 --> 12:43.482
Nyah! Burning!
呀！燃烧！

12:43.620 --> 12:45.655
Burning!
燃烧！

12:47.206 --> 12:48.793
[zany laugh]
[滑稽的笑声]

12:48.862 --> 12:49.896
Ugh!
啊!

12:50.000 --> 12:51.275
Oh, yeah!
哦，是啊！

12:52.344 --> 12:55.689
Today, I am pushing it
to the limit!
今天我就来推一下
到极限！

12:58.172 --> 12:59.827
[groans] Whew!
[呻吟] 哇！

13:01.000 --> 13:01.931
Whew!
哇！

13:02.758 --> 13:04.068
Shoo!
嘘！

13:04.172 --> 13:05.000
Whew!
哇！

13:05.103 --> 13:07.275
[bones cracking]
[骨头碎裂]

13:09.241 --> 13:10.275
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

13:10.413 --> 13:13.172
Time for a new personal best!
是时候创造新的个人最好成绩了！

13:13.275 --> 13:14.310
[straining]
[紧张]

13:15.172 --> 13:16.655
[groans]
[呻吟]

13:17.172 --> 13:20.517
Half... way... there... !
一半……一半……那里……！

13:20.586 --> 13:22.758
[straining]
[紧张]

13:23.862 --> 13:26.000
[slow-motion groan]
[慢动作呻吟]

13:27.241 --> 13:28.482
-[thud]
-[car horn honks]
-[砰]
-[汽车喇叭鸣响]

13:28.586 --> 13:31.344
-[bell ringing]
-[explosion]
-[铃声响起]
-[爆炸]

13:32.413 --> 13:34.793
[engine revs]
[发动机转速]

13:36.586 --> 13:40.103
[straining]
[紧张]

13:41.310 --> 13:43.379
I'm pinned!
我被钉住了！

13:43.896 --> 13:46.344
Okay, SpongeBob,
you can figure this out.
好吧，海绵宝宝，
你可以弄清楚这一点。

13:46.448 --> 13:48.379
Just keep calm!
保持冷静！

13:48.482 --> 13:50.068
Hmm. Can't see anything.
唔。什么也看不见。

13:50.172 --> 13:53.551
I know! I'll let my foot fingers
do the walking.
我知道！我会让我的脚手指
走路。

13:53.620 --> 13:57.310
There's gotta be something
in here that can help me.
一定有什么东西
在这里可以帮助我。

13:57.724 --> 14:00.448
Hmm. Nope, too toothy.
唔。不行，太露齿了。

14:01.448 --> 14:02.758
Too spicy.
太辣了。

14:03.517 --> 14:04.931
Too crowbar-y.
太撬棍了。

14:05.862 --> 14:08.448
Ow! Too snappy!
噢！太快了！

14:08.551 --> 14:09.620
Ooh!
哦！

14:09.724 --> 14:10.931
[chomp]
[咀嚼]

14:11.034 --> 14:12.551
Oh, no good!
哦，不好！

14:12.620 --> 14:14.517
What am I gonna... [gasp]
我要做什么...[喘气]

14:14.620 --> 14:16.413
Gary will save me!
加里会救我的！

14:16.482 --> 14:17.517
Gary!
加里！

14:17.655 --> 14:19.103
-Come in here, buddy!
-[meows]
-进来吧，伙计！
-[喵]

14:19.206 --> 14:20.724
I need you!
我需要你！

14:20.827 --> 14:22.275
[annoyed meow]
[生气喵]

14:22.344 --> 14:24.068
Please, Gary?
拜托，加里？

14:24.172 --> 14:25.827
Oh, Garebear...
哦，加贝尔...

14:25.965 --> 14:28.034
[French narrator]
One hour later...
[法语旁白]
一小时后...

14:28.137 --> 14:31.724
Come on, Gary... I need you.
来吧，加里……我需要你。

14:33.068 --> 14:34.137
Meow?
喵？

14:34.241 --> 14:36.000
Oh, Gary!
Thank goodness!
哦，加里！
谢天谢地！

14:36.137 --> 14:37.793
I'm trapped beneath this bar.
我被困在这个酒吧下面了。

14:37.896 --> 14:39.482
Come get it off me, please.
请过来把它从我身上拿下来。

14:39.620 --> 14:41.068
Hurry! Yeah!
匆忙！是的！

14:41.172 --> 14:42.344
You're doing it, Gary!
你正在做，加里！

14:42.448 --> 14:45.103
Just a little closer...
再近一点...

14:46.137 --> 14:48.344
Uh, what are you doing, buddy?
呃，你在做什么，伙计？

14:48.448 --> 14:49.517
-[snoring]
-Aww.
-[打鼾]
-哇。

14:49.620 --> 14:51.620
Poor little guy's
all tuckered out.
可怜的小家伙
全部都被掏空了。

14:51.724 --> 14:53.172
[meowing, snoring]
[喵喵声，打鼾声]

14:53.310 --> 14:56.448
Uh, not sure this is
helping me though.
呃，不确定这是
不过帮助我。

14:57.344 --> 14:58.965
Wait! Gary always keeps
等待！加里始终坚持

14:59.068 --> 15:01.448
a journaling pen
inside his shell!
日记笔
在他的壳里！

15:01.551 --> 15:04.413
[muttering]
[嘀咕]

15:04.517 --> 15:06.172
Eureka!
尤里卡！

15:07.413 --> 15:08.827
"Send help.
“发送帮助。

15:08.896 --> 15:11.827
I've become trapped under my
weights in my upstairs gym.
我已经被困在我的
在我楼上的健身房里举重。

15:11.896 --> 15:13.655
My name is SpongeBob.
我的名字是海绵宝宝。

15:13.724 --> 15:16.172
My snail's name is Gary.
我的蜗牛叫加里。

15:16.241 --> 15:18.586
Gary is here too,
but he fell asleep,
加里也来了
但他睡着了，

15:18.724 --> 15:22.000
so I'm relying on you,
kind stranger."
所以我依赖你
善良的陌生人。”

15:25.344 --> 15:28.862
Soon it'll be just a matter
of time before I'm rescued!
很快这将只是一个问题
距离我获救还有一段时间！

15:29.000 --> 15:30.068
[grunts]
[咕哝]

15:31.241 --> 15:32.862
Oh, come on!
哦，来吧！

15:32.965 --> 15:34.724
[bottle whooshing]
[瓶子嘶嘶作响]

15:34.862 --> 15:35.655
[cries out]
[喊叫]

15:35.724 --> 15:37.793
Hey! What's the big idea?
嘿！有什么大创意？

15:37.862 --> 15:41.689
Ohh! Alright, who threw this?
哦！好吧，这是谁扔的？

15:42.206 --> 15:43.172
Oh!
哦！

15:43.241 --> 15:45.655
That does it, wisenheimer!
就这样，威森海默！

15:45.758 --> 15:46.896
[phone ringing]
[电话铃声]

15:47.000 --> 15:48.758
Bikini Bottom Police Department.
比基尼警察局。

15:48.862 --> 15:50.827
How may I protect and serve?
我该如何保护和服务？

15:50.896 --> 15:54.310
[unintelligible
angry muttering]
[难以理解
愤怒的嘀咕]

15:54.413 --> 15:55.620
An assault!
袭击！

15:55.724 --> 15:57.413
Not in our town!
我们镇上没有啊！

15:57.517 --> 16:00.103
We'll send a squad boat
right away!
我们会派出一艘小艇
马上！

16:00.206 --> 16:02.655
To the cop mobile!
到警察手机！

16:05.172 --> 16:07.103
[loud squeaking]
[大声吱吱声]

16:15.862 --> 16:17.000
Hit it.
击中它。

16:18.103 --> 16:20.931
[mimics siren sound]
[模仿警报声]

16:22.448 --> 16:26.758
Ha-ha! You hear that,
mysterious miscreant?
哈哈！你听到了，
神秘的恶棍？

16:26.896 --> 16:29.103
You are so...
你真是……

16:29.206 --> 16:30.206
Saved!
得救了！

16:30.275 --> 16:32.448
Oh, Gary, I'm saved!
哦，加里，我得救了！

16:32.551 --> 16:35.862
[snoring, meowing]
[打鼾、喵喵声]

16:35.965 --> 16:37.275
[police radio chatter]
[警察电台喋喋不休]

16:37.379 --> 16:40.413
Uh, what was that address again?
呃，那个地址又是什么？

16:41.275 --> 16:44.310
-Oh, it's... Squidward!
-Squidward!
-哦，这是……章鱼哥！
-章鱼哥！

16:44.448 --> 16:47.103
Man, that guy's always calling.
伙计，那个家伙总是打电话来。

16:47.206 --> 16:50.448
Yeah, last time
it was because of a trespassing
是的，上次
这是因为非法侵入

16:50.586 --> 16:52.896
sea-fly in his living room!
海蝇在他的客厅里！

16:54.965 --> 16:57.241
Oh, shrimp, there he is!
哦，虾，他来了！

16:57.344 --> 16:58.413
Duck!
鸭子！

16:59.275 --> 17:01.655
Over here, officers!
这边，军官们！

17:01.793 --> 17:03.310
What-- What the--?
什么——什么——？

17:03.896 --> 17:07.000
Well, they did say they were
gonna send a squad boat.
嗯，他们确实说过他们是
会派出一艘小艇。

17:07.103 --> 17:09.172
[blows raspberry] Idiots.
[吹覆盆子]白痴。

17:10.517 --> 17:13.344
Oh... they didn't stop.
哦……他们没有停下来。

17:13.793 --> 17:16.000
Must knock bottle out of window!
必须把瓶子打出窗外！

17:16.103 --> 17:19.448
Ooh, finally I can put
these gym tools to use!
哦，终于可以放了
这些健身工具好用！

17:19.931 --> 17:21.517
[grunts]
[咕哝]

17:24.793 --> 17:27.448
Hmm. Nothing left to throw.
唔。没有什么可以扔的。

17:27.551 --> 17:30.344
[gasp] Except... Gary.
[喘气]除了……加里。

17:30.482 --> 17:33.000
Sorry, buddy,
you're my only hope.
对不起，哥们，
你是我唯一的希望。

17:33.103 --> 17:33.965
[grunts]
[咕哝]

17:34.068 --> 17:35.275
Okay, Gary,
好吧，加里，

17:35.379 --> 17:38.344
try to knock the bottle
out of the window.
尝试敲瓶子
窗外。

17:38.965 --> 17:42.862
[snoring, meowing]
[打鼾、喵喵声]

17:42.965 --> 17:45.551
Oh, I've really done it now!
哦，我现在真的做到了！

17:45.655 --> 17:47.448
All hope is lost!
所有的希望都破灭了！

17:47.517 --> 17:50.034
I've tried everything
and failed!
我已经尝试了一切
并失败了！

17:50.137 --> 17:54.275
All conceivable chances
of escape, exhausted!
所有能想到的机会
逃跑的时候，累死了！

17:54.379 --> 17:56.172
[phone ringing]
[电话铃声]

17:56.275 --> 17:57.931
Oh yeah, the phone!
哦，对了，电话！

18:00.241 --> 18:01.827
Sweet Neptune, help me!
亲爱的海王星，帮帮我吧！

18:01.896 --> 18:04.413
I'm pinned under weights
in my home gym!
我被重压压住
在我家的健身房里！

18:04.551 --> 18:05.931
[radio announcer]
That's correct!
[电台播音员]
没错！

18:06.034 --> 18:08.103
The song of the day is
"Sweet Neptune, Help Me!
当天的歌曲是
“亲爱的海王星，救救我吧！

18:08.241 --> 18:10.448
I'm Pinned Under Weights
in My Home Gym,"
我被重压压垮
在我的家庭健身房，”

18:10.551 --> 18:12.862
by Scalawag and the Sea Dogs!
作者：无赖与海狗！

18:12.931 --> 18:16.896
Listener, you just won
$1,000!
听众，你刚刚赢了
1,000 美元！

18:17.000 --> 18:19.034
I-I... I did?
我-我...我做到了？

18:19.103 --> 18:21.344
Yeah! Ifyou can get down here
是的！如果你能下来这里

18:21.413 --> 18:23.413
to the station
in the next 10 minutes!
到车站
在接下来的 10 分钟内！

18:23.551 --> 18:26.172
K-DEEP, we play the hits!
K-DEEP，我们演奏热门歌曲！

18:27.172 --> 18:28.655
No! Don't hang up!
不！别挂断！

18:28.758 --> 18:30.758
-[disconnect tone]
-Oh, fiddlesticks!
-[断开连接音]
-哦，小提琴手！

18:30.862 --> 18:34.068
Hm, if I randomly hit numbers
with my toe,
嗯，如果我随机击中数字
用我的脚趾，

18:34.172 --> 18:36.000
I'm sure to call somebody.
我肯定会打电话给某人。

18:36.103 --> 18:38.827
[muttering]
[嘀咕]

18:39.413 --> 18:40.758
-Hello?
-Larry!
-你好？
-拉里！

18:40.862 --> 18:43.448
I need your help.
I'm trapped under my weights!
我需要你的帮助。
我被我的重压困住了！

18:43.586 --> 18:45.724
I wish I could help you, bro,
but...
我希望我能帮助你，兄弟
但是...

18:46.172 --> 18:48.137
Larry's got problems
of his own.
拉里有问题
他自己的。

18:48.241 --> 18:49.655
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

18:49.758 --> 18:52.103
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

18:52.241 --> 18:53.344
Eh, hello?
呃，喂？

18:53.413 --> 18:55.413
-[ringing continues]
-Hello?
-[铃声继续]
-你好？

18:55.551 --> 18:59.103
[heavy breathing]
Yes, what is it?
[粗重的呼吸]
是的，那是什么？

18:59.206 --> 19:01.172
Trapped, you say?
你说被困住了？

19:01.310 --> 19:03.034
All alone?
一个人吗？

19:03.137 --> 19:05.482
And you can't move?
而你却不能动？

19:05.586 --> 19:07.724
[chuckles] That sounds...
[笑]听起来……

19:07.827 --> 19:10.655
excruciating.
令人难以忍受。

19:10.793 --> 19:13.517
[heavy breathing through phone]
[电话里传来粗重的呼吸声]

19:13.620 --> 19:16.655
Ew! Uh, sorry, wrong number!
呃！呃，抱歉，号码打错了！

19:17.793 --> 19:19.758
Oh, that's not good.
哦，这样不好。

19:19.862 --> 19:22.241
[French narrator]
Many hours later.
[法语旁白]
许多小时后。

19:22.310 --> 19:26.758
H-help... help...
呼、救命……救命……

19:28.413 --> 19:33.172
[both] There's no one who can
help you now, SpongeBob.
[双双] 没有人可以
现在就帮助你吧，海绵宝宝。

19:34.344 --> 19:36.482
[all] No one!
[全部] 没有人！

19:36.586 --> 19:39.758
No... my friends will find me.
不...我的朋友会找到我的。

19:39.827 --> 19:40.862
How?
如何？

19:40.965 --> 19:43.724
They don't even know
where you are.
他们甚至不知道
你在哪里。

19:44.931 --> 19:48.931
But we know where you are,
big silly!
但我们知道你在哪里
大傻！

19:49.482 --> 19:53.620
We'll be your friends
to the end of your days.
我们会成为你的朋友
直到你生命的尽头。

19:53.724 --> 19:56.034
Hee hee hee
hee hee hee.
嘻嘻嘻
嘻嘻嘻。

19:56.137 --> 20:00.517
[creepy laughter]
[令人毛骨悚然的笑声]

20:00.655 --> 20:04.586
[creepy laughter intensifies]
[令人毛骨悚然的笑声加剧]

20:04.655 --> 20:06.517
[honking laugh]
[喇叭笑声]

20:06.620 --> 20:08.931
[deranged laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

20:09.000 --> 20:10.931
-[doorbell rings]
-A visitor?
-[门铃响了]
-访客？

20:11.000 --> 20:13.655
Oh, I'm saved!
哦，我得救了！

20:13.758 --> 20:14.965
[strained] Come in.
[紧张]进来吧。

20:15.068 --> 20:17.241
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

20:18.241 --> 20:19.379
Hello?
你好？

20:19.482 --> 20:22.655
SpongeBob?
Are you home?
海绵宝宝？
你在家吗？

20:23.103 --> 20:24.620
Up here.
上这里。

20:24.724 --> 20:27.689
I'm up... here.
我起来了……在这里。

20:29.000 --> 20:30.896
I don't hear anything.
我什么也没听到。

20:31.482 --> 20:33.620
The coast is clear!
海岸清澈见底！

20:33.724 --> 20:35.068
-Oh, boy!
-[shouting]
-哦，孩子！
-[喊叫]

20:35.137 --> 20:37.931
This is gonna be
the best surprise party
这将会是
最好的惊喜派对

20:38.000 --> 20:40.310
SpongeBob's ever had!
海绵宝宝曾经有过！

20:40.793 --> 20:42.655
You hear that, Gary?
你听到了吗，加里？

20:42.758 --> 20:44.448
Soon I'll be free.
很快我就会自由了。

20:44.586 --> 20:48.758
[snoring, meowing]
[打鼾、喵喵声]

20:48.827 --> 20:51.793
[cheering and laughing]
[欢呼和大笑]

20:51.896 --> 20:53.310
Eee!
哎呀！

20:53.448 --> 20:56.068
-Hooray!
-Arrr!
-万岁！
-啊啊！

20:58.310 --> 21:01.517
[faintly] H... H... Help!
[微弱地]呼……呼……救命啊！

21:01.586 --> 21:03.206
[gulps air]
[倒吸一口空气]

21:03.275 --> 21:05.862
I'm... upstairs.
我……在楼上。

21:05.931 --> 21:07.586
[chattering]
[喋喋不休]

21:07.689 --> 21:11.448
I wonder what kind of fun stuff
is up there?
我想知道有什么好玩的东西
在上面吗？

21:15.068 --> 21:16.172
[exhales]
[呼气]

21:16.241 --> 21:17.827
Saved.
已保存。

21:18.275 --> 21:20.275
What are ye doing, lads?
小伙子们，你们在做什么？

21:20.379 --> 21:23.448
Keep your mirth and mayhem
downstairs
保持你的欢乐和混乱
楼下

21:23.551 --> 21:26.241
in the designated party area.
在指定的聚会区域。

21:26.344 --> 21:29.103
[both] Aye, aye, Captain.
[两人] 是的，是的，船长。

21:29.206 --> 21:31.862
[SpongeBob, weakly]
Wait! Come back!
[海绵宝宝，有气无力]
等等！回来！

21:31.965 --> 21:33.655
Oh, it's no use.
哦，没用的。

21:33.724 --> 21:36.620
They can't hear my voice.
他们听不到我的声音。

21:36.724 --> 21:40.206
But maybe they can hear
my foot's voice.
但也许他们能听到
我的脚的声音。

21:40.310 --> 21:41.586
[pops]
[流行音乐]

21:41.689 --> 21:43.034
[stomping]
[跺脚]

21:43.137 --> 21:45.206
[loud chatter]
[大声喧哗]

21:45.275 --> 21:47.586
-[foot stomping]
-Quiet!
-[跺脚]
-安静！

21:47.689 --> 21:49.620
Do you hear that?
你听到了吗？

21:49.724 --> 21:53.620
-[rhythmic stomping]
-Ooh! I know this shanty!
-[有节奏的跺脚]
-哦！我知道这个棚屋！

21:54.344 --> 21:55.793
♪ Sweet Neptune, help me
♪ 亲爱的海王星，帮助我

21:55.931 --> 21:57.655
♪ I'm pinned under weights
in my home gym ♪
♪ 我被重压压住了
在我家的健身房里♪

21:57.758 --> 21:59.896
♪ By Jove, by Jim
I tried to be trim ♪
♪ 乔夫，吉姆
我努力让自己变得苗条起来♪

21:59.965 --> 22:01.655
♪ I'm pinned under weights
in my home gym ♪
♪ 我被重压压住了
在我家的健身房里♪

22:01.758 --> 22:03.793
♪ I tried to get buff
but it wasn't enough ♪
♪ 我试图获得增益
但这还不够♪

22:03.862 --> 22:05.862
♪ When the weight had its way,
the going got tough ♪
♪ 当重量发挥作用时，
事情变得艰难♪

22:05.965 --> 22:08.137
-♪ No shimmy or shim
-♪ My quivering limbs ♪
-♪ 无摆振或垫片
-♪ 我的四肢颤抖 ♪

22:08.241 --> 22:09.965
♪ Pinned under weights
in my home gym ♪
♪ 被重物压住
在我家的健身房里♪

22:10.068 --> 22:11.793
♪ So, hoist the barbells
over lads ♪
♪ 所以，举起杠铃
超越小伙子♪

22:11.896 --> 22:13.172
♪ They'll sink
before they swim ♪
♪ 他们会沉没的
在他们游泳之前♪

22:13.310 --> 22:15.655
Uh-oh.
I knew I should have paid extra
呃哦。
我知道我应该支付额外费用

22:15.758 --> 22:17.551
for the shanty-proof floor!
用于防棚地板！

22:17.655 --> 22:20.482
-Whoa!
-[singing stops]
-哇！
-[歌声停止]

22:20.586 --> 22:21.655
[harmonica flourish]
[口琴蓬勃发展]

22:21.758 --> 22:23.551
Surprise!
惊喜！

22:25.000 --> 22:28.517
...and that's why I was almost
late for work this morning.
...这就是为什么我几乎
今天早上上班迟到了。

22:28.965 --> 22:32.275
Stop your lollygagging
and get to work!
停止你的棒棒糖
开始工作吧！

22:32.344 --> 22:34.275
Aye, aye, Mr. Krabs, sir.
是的，是的，蟹老板先生，先生。

22:34.793 --> 22:37.689
[grunting, muttering]
[咕哝，咕哝]

22:37.793 --> 22:39.137
Order up!
赶快下单吧！

22:39.241 --> 22:41.034
[laughs]
[笑]

22:41.137 --> 22:44.655
[end theme music playing]
[结束主题音乐播放]

[结束主题音乐播放]